    <section class="homeIntro" id="skipToContent">
        <div class="row">
               <h2>Our Promise to You...</h2>
        
        	         <p><p>Starting college, coming back or figuring out what&#8217;s next? We&#8217;re here to help you build skills, gain confidence and move forward.</p>
<p>Our <a href="https://online.fliphtml5.com/rfnoa/30709_Admissions_viewbook6x9FLIP/#p=1" rel="noopener" target="_blank">College Viewbook</a> will give you a glimpse of what awaits you here and the self-discoveries you could make along the way!</p>
<p><strong>Take your first step today.<br/><br/></strong></p>
<center class="buttonGroup"><a class="callout" href="https://events.macomb.edu/search/events?event_types%5B%5D=43332713213885" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Schedule a Campus Tour</a><a class="callout" href="https://www.macomb.edu/admissions-aid/index.html"><span>Get Started Now</span></a></center></p>
                </div>
    </section>
