                            <h3>Discover the Best Version of Yourself</h3>
                            <p>Discover your interests, passions and potential. Learn how to transform them into a rewarding career or enriching pastime.</p>
<ul>
<li>Take a look at our programs, certificates and workforce training.</li>
<li>Not sure what to study? Check out an area of interest.</li>
<li>Learn best by doing? Our hands-on programs are for you!</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="callout" href="https://www.macomb.edu/programs-courses/index.html">Learn More</a></p>
