                    <div class="dcaModal connect">  
                        <span class="dcaBackgroundText">Connect</span>
                        <div class="wysiwyg  whiteText ">
                            <h3>Connect and Build Relationships</h3>
                            <p>Meet other students who share your curiosity and connect with faculty and staff who care about your passions, your dreams and your continued success.</p>
<ul>
<li>We offer tons of free resources - counseling and academic advising, tutoring, Reading &amp; Writing Studios, student success seminars and more!</li>
<li>We have a fun and lively campus with student clubs, sports teams, volunteer opportunities and study abroad trips.</li>
<li>Our instructors are friendly, understand the job market and take time to get to know you.</li>
</ul>
<p><br/><a class="callout" href="https://www.macomb.edu/student-life/index.html">Check out Student Life</a><br/><br/></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="dcaInfographics  whiteText "> 
                            <h4>Engaged Students, Personalized Support</h4>                            <div class="dcaInfoRow">
                                                                    <div class="dcaInfo">                                 
                                         <span class="dcaInfoNumber">30+</span>
                                         <span class="dcaInfoBlurb">Student Organizations</span>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="dcaInfo">                                 
                                         <span class="dcaInfoNumber">23:1</span>
                                         <span class="dcaInfoBlurb">Student to Faculty Ratio</span>
                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button aria-label="Close" onclick="closeModal();">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
                                <rect height="60" width="60"/>
                                <path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.625 30C5.625 16.5426 16.5426 5.625 30 5.625C43.4574 5.625 54.375 16.5426 54.375 30C54.375 43.4574 43.4574 54.375 30 54.375C16.5426 54.375 5.625 43.4574 5.625 30ZM30 9.375C18.6137 9.375 9.375 18.6137 9.375 30C9.375 41.3863 18.6137 50.625 30 50.625C41.3863 50.625 50.625 41.3863 50.625 30C50.625 18.6137 41.3863 9.375 30 9.375Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/>
                                <path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18.75 30C18.75 28.9645 19.5895 28.125 20.625 28.125H39.375C40.4105 28.125 41.25 28.9645 41.25 30C41.25 31.0355 40.4105 31.875 39.375 31.875H20.625C19.5895 31.875 18.75 31.0355 18.75 30Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/>
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                                                                  
                    <div class="dcaModal advance">  
                        <span class="dcaBackgroundText">Advance</span>
                        <div class="wysiwyg ">
                            <h3>Advance and Achieve Your Full Potential</h3>
                            <p>We&#8217;ll help you gain the skills, knowledge and confidence to pursue your dreams.</p>
<ul>
<li>Earn your bachelor&#8217;s and advanced degrees through our University Center, located at Center Campus. We&#8217;ve partnered with some of the finest state colleges and universities, offering dozens of programs.</li>
<li>Explore your transfer options with over 300 transfer plans.</li>
<li>Receive credit for prior learning for work and life experiences, saving you time and money.</li>
<li>Land your dream job - our Career Services team can help!</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="callout" href="https://www.macomb.edu/admissions-aid/index.html">Get Started</a></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="dcaInfographics "> 
                            <h4>Success You Can Count On</h4>                            <div class="dcaInfoRow">
                                                                    <div class="dcaInfo">                                 
                                         <span class="dcaInfoNumber">93% </span>
                                         <span class="dcaInfoBlurb">are satisfied with their Macomb experience</span>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="dcaInfo">                                 
                                         <span class="dcaInfoNumber">92%</span>
                                         <span class="dcaInfoBlurb">achieve their educational goals</span>
                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
