          <section class="degrees">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="content" style="background: url('https://www.macomb.edu/_images/degrees-bg.jpg') no-repeat; background-size:cover;">
                <span class="subheading">Academics</span>
                <h2>Find your path</h2>
                <p>Our programs will put you on a career path filled with endless opportunities. We have the support and resources to help you earn an associate degree, transfer to a four-year school of your choice, land an apprenticeship or fast-track your career with a skills certificate. And if you simply don&#8217;t know, we&#8217;ll help you.</p>
<p><a class="callout" href="https://www.macomb.edu/programs-courses/index.html">Start Your Journey</a><br/><br/></p>    
