		<div class="community">
    <section class="fromOurBlog">
                    <h2>Happening On Campus</h2>
                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                        <strong class="blueText">From Our Blog</strong>
                <a class="top-right read-more" href="https://www.macomb.edu/blog/index.html">All Stories</a>
        <div class="row">
                             <div class="col image">
                    <img alt="A veteran student receives help from a counselor." src="https://www.macomb.edu/resources/blogs/images/trending-blog/111326-veteran-friendly-blog.jpg"/>
                </div>
                        <div class="col content">
                                    <a class="boldLink" href="https://www.macomb.edu/blog/2026/11/veteran-friendly.html">Veteran-Friendly College Support at Macomb</a>
                                                    <p>When their military service ends, some veterans choose to return to school and earn a degree or certificate. However, adjusting civilian life and working with the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs (VA), can be challenging. Macomb&#8217;s Veteran and Military Services (VMS) department is designed specifically to help veterans and their family members with those unique challenges.</p>
                                <a class="read-more" href="https://www.macomb.edu/blog/2026/11/veteran-friendly.html">Read Full Story</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        </section>
    
